 in municipal commitment notes (notas de empenho).\n   - **Date:** 03/06/2026 (not directly needed in the output unless specified, but good to keep in mind).\n   - **Language/Style:** pt-BR, formal, objective, technical. NO markdown unless JSON is requested. Do not invent missing data. Flag pending items when necessary.\n   - **Format Requirement:** EXCLUSIVELY UPPERCASE. Must start exactly with \"PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A\".\n   - **Required Elements:** Secretaria, objeto, finalidade, período, referências (processo, pregão, contrato, nota fiscal) when they exist.\n   - **Context Provided:** All fields marked as \"Nao informado\" except for a base text: \"GASOLINA PARA SAUDE DIESEL VALOR 20000,00\".\n   - **Base Text Interpretation:** Object: GASOLINA E DIESEL. Purpose/Department: SAUDE. Value: 20000,00. Other fields: missing.\n\n2.  **Identify Constraints & Requirements:**\n   - Start exactly with: \"PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A\"\n   - ALL CAPS\n   - NO MARKDOWN\n   - Formal, objective, technical pt-BR\n   - Include: secretaria, objeto, finalidade, período, referências (if available)\n   - Do not invent missing data\n   - Flag pending items when necessary\n   - Base text provides: objeto (GASOLINA E DIESEL), finalidade/secretaria (SAUDE), valor (20000,00). Others are missing.\n\n3.  **Draft Construction (Mental Refinement - ALL CAPS):**\n   PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A AQUISICAO DE COMBUSTIVEIS, ESPECIFICAMENTE GASOLINA E DIESEL, DESTINADOS A SECRETARIA MUNICIPAL DE SAUDE, COM A FINALIDADE DE ABASTECIMENTO DA FROTA DE VEICULOS OFICIAIS UTILIZADOS NAS ATIVIDADES DE ATENCAO A SAUDE. PERIODO DE COMPETENCIA: NAO INFORMADO. REFERENCIAS ADMINISTRATIVAS: PROCESSO ADMINISTRATIVO NAO INFORMADO, PREGAO/LICITACAO NAO INFORMADO, CONTRATO NAO INFORMADO E NOTA FISCAL/REFERENCIA NAO INFORMADA. PENDENCIAS: REGULARIZACAO DOS DADOS DE SECRETARIA, PERIODO DE COMPETENCIA, NUMEROS DE PROCESSO, LICITACAO, CONTRATO E DOCUMENTO FISCAL PARA CONCLUSAO DO REGISTRO CONTABIL. VALOR EMPENHADO: R$ 20.000,00.\n\n4.  **Check Constraints:**\n   - Starts exactly with \"PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A\"? Yes.\n   - Exclusively uppercase? Yes.\n   - No markdown? Yes.\n   - Formal, objective, technical pt-BR? Yes.\n   - Includes secretaria, objeto, finalidade, período, referências? Yes, explicitly states what''s provided and flags missing ones.\n   - Does not invent missing data? Yes, explicitly marks them as \"NAO INFORMADO\" and flags them as pending.\n   - Value included? Yes, from base text.\n   - Date mentioned? Not required, but context says today is 03/06/2026. I won''t add it unless necessary, but the prompt says \"Hoje é 03/06/2026\" just as context. I''ll stick to the exact start requirement.\n\n   Let''s verify the exact start: \"PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A\" -> matches exactly.\n   Check for markdown: I will ensure absolutely no asterisks, underscores, hashes, etc.\n   Check tone: Technical, municipal accounting style.\n   Check missing data handling: Explicitly flagged as pending.\n\n   One minor adjustment: The prompt says \"Inclua secretaria, objeto, finalidade, período e referências como processo, pregão, contrato ou nota fiscal quando existirem.\" Since they don''t exist in the context, I should state they are pending/missing, which I did. I''ll make it slightly more aligned with standard municipal commitment note phrasing while keeping it strictly uppercase and markdown-free.\n\n   Draft:\n   PELA DESPESA EMPENHADA REFERENTE A AQUISICAO DE COMBUSTIVEIS, ESPECIFICAMENTE GASOLINA E DIESEL, DESTINADOS A SECRETARIA DE SAUDE, COM A FINALIDADE DE ABASTECIMENTO DA FROTA DE VEICULOS OFICIAIS PARA ATENDIMENTO DAS DEMANDAS DO SETOR DE SAUDE. PERIODO DE COMPETENCIA: NAO INFORMADO. REFERENCIAS ADMINISTRATIVAS: PROCESSO ADMINISTRATIVO NAO INFORMADO, PREGAO/LICITACAO NAO INFORMADO, CONTRATO NAO INFORMADO E NOTA FISCAL OU REFERENCIA NAO INFORMADA. PENDENCIAS: NECESSARIO INFORMAR SECRETARIA RESPONSABIL, PERIODO DE VIGENCIA, NUMER